[][kernel][common][eth][Update Airoha AN8811HB 2.5G PHY driver to v1.0.0]
[Description]
Update Airoha AN8811HB 2.5G PHY driver to v1.0.0.

Change Log:
[2026/02/25] v1.0.0
1. EEE support
2. Add LED mode control and temperature monitoring via debugfs
3. Refactor GPIO and clock driver register definitions

MD32 FW 26022502 Updated
- IEEE compliance optimization
- EEE support
- Fix for incorrect parameter settings related to Pair swap
- Surge 5R support
- Temperature Sensor support
- 2.5G/1G/100M link stability and performance optimization

DTS Example:
========================================================================
If your board that GMAC2 connects with Airoha AN8811HB, please change
the eth node as following.

&eth {
	...

	gmac1: mac@1 {
		compatible = "mediatek,eth-mac";
		reg = <1>;
		phy-mode = "2500base-x";
		phy-handle = <&phy13>;
	};

	mdio: mdio-bus {
      		#address-cells = <1>;
      		#size-cells = <0>;

      		phy13: phy@13 {
       			compatible = "ethernet-phy-idc0ff.04a0";
			reg = <13>;
			phy-mode = "2500base-x";
			full-duplex;
			pause;
			airoha,phy-handle;
		};

       		...
	};
};
========================================================================
In addition, if AN8811HB connects with a RESET GPIO, please check the
GPIO number, and then add reset-gpio related definition to above phy
node.

reset-gpios = <&gpio 6 1>;
reset-assert-us = <10000>;
reset-deassert-us = <10000>;
========================================================================

Note:
* SerDes polarity setting could be configured in dts. Please refer to
the following description.
Tx Reverse, Rx Normal:
		airoha,pnswap-tx;
Tx Normal, Rx Normal:
		There is no need to add pnswap property in the DTS.
Tx Reverse, Rx Reverse:
		airoha,pnswap-tx;
		airoha,pnswap-rx;
Tx Normal, Rx Reverse:
		airoha,pnswap-rx;

* Co-clock output setting could be configured in dts. Please refer to
the following description.
- Co-clock output - Disabled
Do not add "airoha,cko-out" in DTS
- Co-clock output - Enabled
Add "airoha,cko-out;"

* phy-handle setting (for AN8811HB initialized) could be configured in dts. Please refer to the following description.
- Work with phy-handle
Add "airoha,phy-handle;" in DTS
- Work with fixed-link
Do not add "airoha,phy-handle" in DTS

* Surge protection setting could be configured in dts. Please refer to the following description.
Surge protection - 0R
Do not add "airoha,surge-5r" in DTS.
Surge protection - 5R
Add "airoha,surge-5r;"

Without this patch, unexpected issues may occur with Airoha AN8811HB.

